e get to the club early, we will get a seat.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Conditional Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  If we get to the club early,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">we will get a seat.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "As soon as you arrive, you will be ushered through the doors by the host.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If he thinks we are coming with him tonight, he will be sorely mistaken.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When this happens to you, I will remember this conversation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Before you e-mail, we will need to come up with a plan.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "After you have that uncomfortable experience, you will feel shocked and insulted.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "chic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "following the current fashion or style; fashionable and appealing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The decor at that new club in the city is so chic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use in a conversation between two people.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "compliment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a remark that says something good about someone or something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Maybe you should see it as a compliment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob08aud02", "type": "audio"