Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le16ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Vanessa, you can e-mail Peter on my cellphone, if you like. I just can't make or receive calls.  If he calls back now, he will be sent directly to voicemail anyway.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Sure, it just cut off. He was telling about that new dance club Shimmer on the harbor. Cellphones can be so frustrating sometimes.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         I heard from a co-worker that  the music is terrible, the drinks are overpriced and the dance floor is tiny ... She was not impressed!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     If he thinks we are coming with him tonight, he will be sorely mistaken. Before you e-mail, we will need to come up with a plan.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Maybe you can suggest Cloudwalk? The music's always pumping and they have a cheap cover charge.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     That place is full of college students. If another nineteen year old approaches me for my number, I will scream.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:          That's funny. Maybe you should see it as a compliment ...<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     When this happens to you, I will remember this conversation ... After you have that uncomfortable experience, you will feel shocked and insulted.", "time": "34000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Right ... so what am I going to write in this e-mail then? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     What about Soiree, on Lanister Blvd.? I saw a blog about it online. I'll find it on your phone ... Here look!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Wow, it's so modern and chic. And those huge, comfy sofas will be a great place to take a break from all the dancing we'll be doing.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Add the link to the e-mail. If Peter doesn't agree to this place, I'll be so annoyed!", "time": "59000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn7le16ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "Descriptive Paragraph", "time": "1", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "<li>Soiree</li>", "time": "24000", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "<li>What does the paragraph include?</li>", "time": "77000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "static", "id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "engenn7le16ob08re5img01.jpg"}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}